  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 207.02 Scope. This part shall apply to:\n\n(a) Public forums required pursuant to RSA 79-A:4, III, at which interested persons may testify and submit information or written testimony; and\n\n(b) Subcommittee meetings at which interested persons may testify and submit information or written testimony.\n\nSource. #8570-B, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 2-18-14\n\nNew. #11163, INTERIM, eff 8-24-16, EXPIRED: 2-20-17\n\nNew. #12857-A, eff 8-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cub100-300.html"
